--[[
    RABAK Explorer
    Remote explorer + script viewer + remote spy

    Usage:
      Run this file as a LocalScript / paste it into your executor.

    Tabs:
      REMOTES  - list remotes, inspect them, and fire/invoke them
      SCRIPTS  - list scripts and view decompiled source
      SPY      - capture outgoing and incoming remote traffic

    Notes:
      Script source viewing needs decompile() support from your executor.
      Outgoing remote logging needs hookmetamethod() / getnamecallmethod().
      Listing and firing remotes works without those APIs.
]]

